#: ../../src/pyvista_wasm/light.py:docstring of pyvista_wasm.light.Light:14
msgid "The type of the light. One of ``'Headlight'``, ``'CameraLight'`` or ``'SceneLight'``.      - A headlight is attached to the camera, looking at its       focal point along the axis of the camera.      - A camera light also moves with the camera, but it can       occupy a general position with respect to it.      - A scene light is stationary with respect to the scene,       as it does not follow the camera. This is the default."
msgstr ""

